get.description:
Everything the designer is built from:
- `components[]`: type, label, category, icon, allowed slots and screen kinds, **variants** (design choices), whether it takes a header / layout (column & row limits, scroll modes) / style, `propsSchema`, allowed data `sources`, static `items` schema, children, `minAppVersion`, `defaults` to drop on the canvas;
- `blocks`: JSON Schemas of header, layout, style, visibility;
- `actions[]`, `sources[]`, `conditionsSchema` (targeting), group schemas (items, rule, schedule, media, landing), `themeSchema`, `limits`.

`x-localized: true` = language map; `x-media` = `{ "mediaId": "…" }` (upload with POST /account/media, purpose BANNER). Cache by `registryChecksum`.
